WEBVTT

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:09.430
That smells wonderful, Toma-san.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:12.410
I've prepared bouillabaisse
for dinner tonight,

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:15.840
so I thought I'd bake a variety
of breads to go with it.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.100
Looks delicious!

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:22.740
I invented this tomato bread for Hotsuma-kun,
since he hates tomatoes.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.770
I hope he likes it.

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:28.400
That's amazing.
I'm sure he'll be delighted.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:32.780
Preparing delicious food
for all of you is my job.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:38.500
As a member of the family, it's an honor
to work at the Twilight Mansion.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.580
Looks like you've outdone yourself
this evening, as well.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:47.680
Doctor! Stop drinking that and
eat a proper dinner!

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.560
I came, drawn by the smell, but...

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:55.550
I was up all night again.
I'm not hungry.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:01:01.030
I'll come by with your dinner later,
so be sure to eat it!

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:02.390
Smells good.

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:05.900
Tsukumo-kun, what are you eating?

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:08.840
Fish roe-flavored takoyaki-kun.

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:10.740
Come on!

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:13.140
Dinner will be ready soon!

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:15.300
Really, fish roe-flavored takoyaki-kun...

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.780
I could get used to this.

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:30.800
Only I know your pain...

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:32.870
Your uncertainty...

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:36.220
Your loneliness...

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:41.330
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:47.770
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:57.950
I will not betray you!

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:43.550
The Twilight Mansion has a communal bath?

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:46.170
Yeah. You haven't been
there yet, have you?

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:49.940
Hotsuma-kun...

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:54.220
This is the communal bath.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:07.030
Brand Zess

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:10.240
You peeping toms!

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:12.960
If you don't want to be seen, lock the door!

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:14.710
Just don't look, you idiot!

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:21.190
I apologize. The lock was broken,
so we put up a sign.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:22.880
Girls           Keep out!
Occupied

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:25.240
Sorry. We didn't notice.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:26.860
Are you sure?

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:27.750
Really, it's true!

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.540
And I honestly didn't see anything!

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.680
I'm not worried about you, Yuki-chan.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:35.330
We've bathed together plenty of...

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:39.910
I used to be a girl?

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:40.780
Yes...

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.270
You are pretty cute, Yuki-kun...

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:45.320
I'm a man!

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:47.480
I'm just kidding.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:57.120
Why do I have to bathe with this guy?

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.120
Hotsuma.

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:00.870
I used to be a girl, huh?

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:04.220
Do you ever wonder about previous lives?

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:06.340
Yes, a little.

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:12.590
But it seems Toko-chan doesn't want
to remind you of what happened.

00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:15.140
Quit being such a downer!

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.090
S-Sorry...

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.140
Hey, where is Shusei-kun?

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:23.730
Oh, I...

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:27.450
Shusei never bathes with us.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:28.860
Really?

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:39.010
Hotsuma.

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:41.110
Shusei...

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:44.630
I thought you'd left a while ago.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:50.710
You don't need to hide it.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.640
I gave you this wound.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:03.060
It doesn't bother me at all.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:16.630
What is it, Sodom?

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:20.730
Luka?

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.830
Did something happen?

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:34.550
I was just thinking about Hotsuma-kun.

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:37.120
I see.

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:43.480
Everyone's got their own
problems, don't they?

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:52.140
Starting tomorrow, I'll be walking you
to and from school.

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.440
Thank you.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:11.240
Did he smile for me just now?

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:31.440
So far, everything has gone according to plan.
For the time being, Yuki is ours.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:34.970
Your move, Reiga...

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:45.080
See you later, Yuki-chan.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:49.790
Takashiro-sama asked to see us,
so we'll catch up later.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.040
Okay.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.180
See you later.

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:55.010
Be careful.

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.790
I didn't realize you had a license.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:02.930
A license?

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:04.560
You don't mean...

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:07.390
You mean this thing?

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:09.030
Oh, yes.

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:11.050
Takashiro sent it to me.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:15.280
He has authority for that, too...

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:16.900
I suppose he does.

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:31.010
Check out that car.

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.360
Who's in it?

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:52.280
That guy is too hot...

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:54.030
Is he a celebrity?

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:57.140
That guy's cute, too!

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:58.740
Is he a transfer student?

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:02.700
You'll be fine on your own here, won't you?

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:05.840
Yes, thank you.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.160
I'll see you later.

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:12.520
I'll be here to pick you up.

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:14.140
Okay.

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:27.600
Yuki.

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:31.510
Kanata-san!

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:35.020
I haven't seen you in a while.

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:40.300
Why... Where have you been?

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:43.820
I'm sorry. I made you worry.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.830
Yes.

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:49.970
I wanted to see you sooner,

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:53.250
but the director gave me
the wrong address.

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:56.170
I'm glad I came to check your school.

00:09:56.170 --> 00:10:00.550
I'm sorry I came here without telling you.

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:02.130
It's fine.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:06.140
I was the one who cut off
communication first.

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.390
Did something happen?

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:11.310
This and that...

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:14.990
More importantly, have
you become involved

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:18.160
in something terrible with that guy,
who was just here?

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.610
No...

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:22.220
I'm worried about you.

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.890
Are you sure nothing is bothering you?

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:29.790
Are you sure you really belong here?

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:31.700
Come back with me...

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:35.020
Yuki.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:38.500
Kanata-san...

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:40.720
Yuki-chan!

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:42.970
What's going on?

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.290
Who are they?

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:54.600
We're Yuki-chan's relatives.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.770
Do you need to speak with Yuki?

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:01.730
I'll call you.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:09.170
I await a favorable response.

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:10.510
Goodbye.

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:13.300
Kanata-san.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.580
Was that...

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:22.420
He's from Yuki's orphanage, isn't he?

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:27.400
We grew up together.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.420
He's like a brother.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.360
Did something happen?

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:48.830
No, it's nothing...

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:50.530
You look sad.

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:54.790
Actually, I saw Kanata-san this morning.

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:58.970
He asked if I'd go back home with him...

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:04.130
But I've made up my mind to
live with the Giou Clan.

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:06.600
Will you be all right?

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:13.360
Kanata-san and the children
are like my family.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:20.460
I'm pathetic. It takes hardly anything
to make me question my decisions.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:25.820
I want to help everyone at the Twilight Mansion,
but I care about Kanata-san, too.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:28.440
You should do as you please.

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:33.540
Wherever you go, wherever you stray,
I'll be with you.

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:38.110
Luka, why would you...

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:42.140
Sorry to ask so suddenly.

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:46.710
But I've been wondering
about it for a while.

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.970
Because you are my master.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:52.880
Master...

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:01.770
Do Not Enter

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:17.330
So this is Giou Yuki.

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:23.240
Watch your step. They say the
guy in black is dangerous.

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:26.500
Whatever. Let's take them out.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:27.680
Luka.

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:29.770
Don't worry. Stand back.

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:31.970
Let's go!

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:34.850
Giou Yuki is mine!

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:36.220
Futile.

00:13:39.850 --> 00:13:41.680
Wha- Our familiars!

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:42.850
An Opast, huh?

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:44.310
Begone.

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:50.180
Gallica! Isis! What the hell are you?

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.030
That mark...

00:13:55.490 --> 00:14:01.250
Swords for eyes, night for hair,
beloved servant of the demon king...

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.590
Are you Luka Crosszeria?

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:10.210
Took you a while to notice.

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:22.230
What? Done already?

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:25.060
Damn it.

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:28.010
You backstabber!

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:30.410
I told you it was futile!

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:35.230
He deflected it...

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:41.060
Stop! Please don't kill me!

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:44.050
You should have chosen your
battles more wisely.

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:07.060
<i>You're Brand Zess? Of the
sinful betrayer clan?!</i>

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.980
Are you afraid?

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:14.390
Of me, a Duras?

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:17.070
No.

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:24.920
Please tell me more
about yourself, Luka.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.080
I was constantly fighting.

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:33.590
For no other reason
than my master's command,

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:36.550
I sank myself in a sea of blood.

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:42.620
And eventually, I gave up on questioning.

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:46.300
Born into a sinful clan,

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:49.060
I knew nothing would change

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:52.390
so long as this mark remained,
etched into my body.

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:58.610
So long as I had this brand of sinners...

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:01.240
But why...

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:05.170
A long time ago, my ancestors
committed a terrible crime.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.370
But...

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:08.340
I didn't care what happened.

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:12.540
A lifetime, fighting only for others...

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:17.440
But everything has changed since then.

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:24.300
Ever since the day I met you,
I've had a reason to live.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:29.470
I live to protect you.
Protecting you is everything to me.

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:31.680
Is that...

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:34.940
Is that really me?

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:52.000
It's Toko. Do you have a minute?

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.790
Sure, go ahead.

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:57.380
Yuki-chan was attacked by Duras again.

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:59.310
How is he?

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:04.420
He's fine. According to Luka,
they were attacked by three Mid-Villains.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:05.600
I see.

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:07.770
Don't let down your guard.

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:11.580
I don't understand.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:17.400
Sending Mid-Villains to attack Yuki...

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.360
How did he respond?

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:22.540
Takashiro-sama was surprisingly calm.

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:23.440
I see.

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:28.060
I know Luka's with him,
but I'm still worried.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:28.750
Yeah.

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:30.920
Hey, Tsukumo.

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:37.130
Why do you think Yuki-chan was
born as a boy this time?

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:46.590
Yuki-chan was a girl last time and
all the previous times, right?

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:50.460
Then, why?

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.110
Why, indeed.

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:55.260
Maybe it's a sign that things are ending.

00:17:55.980 --> 00:18:03.950
Some higher power could be telling us
all this fighting is coming to an end.

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:08.240
Do you really think we can win?

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:09.730
It'll be okay.

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:13.170
I'll protect you, Toko-chan.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:14.640
Tsukumo...

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:19.620
That's right. You have to protect
your loved ones first.

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:25.290
Right now, we just need to
do whatever we can.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:27.010
Yeah.

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:33.810
<i>Is that really me?</i>

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:36.890
There!

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:41.400
What do you think?

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:44.150
A cross...

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:49.290
Takashiro-san told me anything I made
would function as a protective charm.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:52.290
Here.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:19:00.570
I wanted to thank you for protecting me.

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:06.130
But this is all I can do right now.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:13.600
You think of me as your master,

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:17.020
and I don't remember anything
from before I was reborn.

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:19.690
But I don't want you to suffer.

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:25.110
You're important to me.

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:29.960
Thank you.

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:37.410
You made these for us, Yuki-chan?

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:44.180
They're not that well made, but I wanted
to do something to help everyone.

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:49.090
Wow! They're beautiful!

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:52.820
Do you not wear necklaces?

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:55.590
Don't be silly. They're beautiful.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.330
You'll wear it, won't you, Tsukumo?

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:58.060
Sure.

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:02.940
Um...

00:20:04.110 --> 00:20:07.220
There's one for you, if you'd like it.

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:10.260
Thank you. I'm delighted.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:13.620
I made one for Hotsuma-kun, too...

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:18.120
I'll give it to him.

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:20.080
Thank you.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:23.900
Is Hotsuma sleeping in again?

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:28.850
It's because he's always up late,
playing games.

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:30.840
Hotsuma really likes his games.

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:35.730
Um, Shusei-kun...

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:39.070
Are you feeling unwell?

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.870
Are you, Shusei?

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:45.600
No, I'm fine.

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:58.600
Wakamiya Kanata

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:09.910
You have reached an automated
voice messaging service.

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.880
Please leave your message after the tone.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:19.010
Hello, Kanata-san.
It's Yuki.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:26.560
I'm sorry, but I can't go back
with you yet, Kanata-san.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.900
I'd like to meet to talk
about this in person.

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:10.450
Reiga-sama, what are you looking at?

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:13.230
Something you cannot see.

00:23:16.010 --> 00:23:18.590
I don't care, as long as
I get to fight.

00:23:19.270 --> 00:23:22.390
Me, too. We still have to stay put?

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:27.770
It's not your turn yet.

00:23:27.770 --> 00:23:28.810
Ashley...

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:36.450
Yuki.

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:37.890
What is it, Luka?

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:40.010
These Takaeda shears are amazing.

00:23:40.010 --> 00:23:43.090
Luka, have you been shopping
by telephone?

00:23:43.090 --> 00:23:45.980
Yes. Now I can groom the
Twilight Mansion's yard.

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:47.460
Scar
You wanted to do that?

00:23:47.460 --> 00:23:48.000
Scar

00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:49.040
I did.

00:23:49.040 --> 00:23:49.780
Scar
